From 344240be685018b85e64ac7ec7233c5939614b3a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: u <u@localhost>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 09:52:50 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: build infrastructure, convspec ARM64 output, CONTEXT86

- CMake: move the x86-only defines to the root file, use lower case
  system library names, use build-machine convspec/widl when cross
  compiling, skip the hypervisor backends on ARM64, fixed image bases
  below 2GB on ARM64.
- convspec: --arm64 emits the 16-bit module as data (x86-16 code as
  bytes, 32-bit addresses as image relative values), ARM64 relay
  functions with SEH unwind info, and marker symbols in place of the
  i386 16<->32 thunks (only compared by the vm86 emulator).
- Rename the x86 register context used for the 16-bit side to
  CONTEXT86 (WOW64_CONTEXT on 64-bit hosts).
- libwine: LDT helpers and fixed selector values on ARM64.
- Fix case of a few system header names.
